1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,109
The same rule everywhere.

2
00:00:02,109 --> 00:00:06,184
Hydrochloric acid gives one, so thirty six point five.

3
00:00:06,184 --> 00:00:12,864
Phosphoric acid, fully neutralised, gives three, so thirty two point six seven.

4
00:00:12,864 --> 00:00:15,976
For bases, count hydroxide ions.

5
00:00:15,976 --> 00:00:18,658
Sodium hydroxide, forty.

6
00:00:18,658 --> 00:00:23,255
Calcium hydroxide, seventy four over two, thirty seven.

